@SagaOutBoxCleanArch.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5249
@orderId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 1. Create a new order (writes CreateOrderCommand and StartSaga outbox rows)
# @name createOrder
POST {{SagaOutBoxCleanArch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/order
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "SKU-123",
  "quantity": 2,
  "unitPrice": 19.99
}

### 2. Get recent orders (most recent 100)
GET {{SagaOutBoxCleanArch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/order
Accept: application/json

### 3. Get order by ID
GET {{SagaOutBoxCleanArch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/order/{{orderId}}
Accept: application/json

### 4. Cancel an order (triggers saga compensation)
POST {{SagaOutBoxCleanArch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/order/{{orderId}}/cancel
Accept: application/json

### 5. Health Check (Order API)
GET {{SagaOutBoxCleanArch.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json
